A||||12||Fformula88||Red Bull... anybody drink this stuff?||||1||
Z||000000||Fformula88||07-20-2001||10:35 PM||||I remember when it showed up at the college bookstore where I worked a few years ago.  Its an energy drink for anybody who is unfamiliar with it.  Well, I tried it once (at $1.99 a can!) and didn't think too much of it.  <P>Yesterday I saw a news report on it about how popular it has become in bars.  Its used in mixed drinks to give a big energy burst while drinking... to keep you awake!  I'm really curios to know if anybody is actually going out to drink Red Bull and Vodka's!  I've never seen it ordered in a bar, but ABC's world news assures me it is the hottest drink going!<P>------------------<BR>John  <BR>AOLIM: Fformula88<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/fierosig2.JPG"> <BR>1988 Fiero Formula<BR>1985 Fiero SE 2M6||||reg||1
Z||000001||AkursedX||07-20-2001||10:40 PM||||I can remember a guy handing this stuff out to us before football practice one day my freshman year of college.  It's pretty good I guess.  <BR>As far as a mixing it with alcohol, I've never done that, but I do it see it ordered quite a bit.  It took me a while to even make the connection that it was the same Red Bull.  I bet it's pretty good, but I'll stick to beer  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P><P>------------------<BR><BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sigpic2_2.jpg"> ||||reg||1
Z||000002||Monkeyman||07-21-2001||12:03 AM||||I manage a convenience store and we just got Red Bull.  The rep gave us free samples.  I can see why it's so popular in bars.  You tend to lose your sense of taste when you're bulletproof.  That stuff is disgusting!  And I didn't feel any rush of energy after drinking it.  The rep said the it's used more than tonic water as a mixer.  I guess 1/2 a glass of vodka tastes the same no matter what you mix it with.  If you want an energy drink that actually works (a little) and has some decent taste (well...better than Red Bull), try Hansons.  It's distributed by 7 Up.  Same size can, same price, but you don't feel quite as ripped off.<P>------------------<BR>'Consciousness:  That annoying time between naps.'<P>MM||||reg||1
Z||000003||DecadenceR||07-21-2001||12:06 AM||||I heard a few kids around here got real sick, one of em died, from mixing the red bulls with something. I'm not sure what they mixed it with, it was alcohol though.||||reg||1
Z||000004||Formula88||07-21-2001||01:39 AM||||I like it.  And yes, I like Red Bull and Vodka, too.  Use good Vodka, though.  Glacier is my preferred brand when I can find it around here.<P>You want nasty?  A hot one for a while was Zima and Vodka.  blech!||||reg||1
Z||000005||Standard||07-21-2001||04:15 AM||||Red bull and vodka.. just like liquid crack  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>I usually only drink the stuff after a race if the Red Bull girls are there.  Snag a can or two while I'm doing my feeble best to hit on them  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>------------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sig_pic_full.jpg">        <BR>1988 Quad 4 Coupe 5 speed<P><FONT SIZE="1">1986 GT 5 speed, 1984 SC Auto<BR><FONT COLOR="red">AOL: LastMinuteBastrd  AIM: SavedbyJebus</FONT></FONT>||||reg||1
