Z||000007||stimpy||07-21-2001||10:10 AM||||I don't know if it is a rep driving it, or someone was fortunate(?) enough to win it in a contest, but there is a Suzuki X-90 with a huge Red Bull can mounted on the "trunk" area always driving around the city here. Ees so funny!<BR>And Monkey is right, theat hansens stuff is much better, especially the Ginko Biloba Cola. Now, for a truly disgusting refreshment, anyone remember Josta? The guarana flavored pop. Hideous stuff, but it would jack you up like a line.  Red Bull & Vodka is for yuppies, hardcores drink Josta and Jager!||||reg||1
